From 9444ddc046dc4a6bb21cc913ecc5a48fee97309e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 18:51:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workflow): mobile runs panel as bottom sheet with
 back-to-edit

Replace the mobile 88vw side drawer with a bottom sheet overlay so the
canvas is not crushed, add drag-handle expand/collapse and a header
back control when viewing a run snapshot.
